>>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
*> @file cobol_orm_test.cbl
*> @brief Auto-generated COBOL Copybook ABI layout test program.
*> @module TST-COBOL-ORM
*> @details Verifies FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH against C ABI layout sizes.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TST-COBOL-ORM.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "cobol_orm.cpy".
*> @record WS-ACTUAL-LEN Measured byte size of current record.
01 WS-ACTUAL-LEN USAGE BINARY-LONG UNSIGNED VALUE 0.
*> @subprogram TST-COBOL-ORM Run ABI byte-length assertions.
*> @return Returns 0 on exact match; non-zero exit on mismatch.
*> @errors Exits with status 1 if any record size mismatches C ABI.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
*> @paragraph MAIN-ENTRY Verify every emitted C struct and union size.
MAIN-ENTRY.
    MOVE CDD-FFI-ABI-READY TO WS-ACTUAL-LEN
    MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(COBOL-ORM-DECIMAL) TO WS-ACTUAL-LEN
    IF WS-ACTUAL-LEN NOT = 41
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(COBOL-ORM-POOL-STATS) TO WS-ACTUAL-LEN
    IF WS-ACTUAL-LEN NOT = 24
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(COBOL-ORM-CPY-INFO) TO WS-ACTUAL-LEN
    IF WS-ACTUAL-LEN NOT = 12
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(COBOL-ORM-COL-INFO) TO WS-ACTUAL-LEN
    IF WS-ACTUAL-LEN NOT = 16
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(COBOL-ORM-COMMAREA) TO WS-ACTUAL-LEN
    IF WS-ACTUAL-LEN NOT = 544
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM TST-COBOL-ORM.
